  "description": "Introducing the all-new Triton Fast: The Ultimate Triathlon Bike for Every Challenge. Whether you're racing down long, straight roads or navigating sharp, twisty turns, the Triton Fast is your perfect companion for achieving your best results in any triathlon. With its progressive geometry, longer reach, and higher headtube, you’ll be able to stay in your aero position for longer, while maintaining unmatched stability and control. Thanks to the flipchips in the fork, you can adjust the bike's handling to suit any course. From flat, fast stretches to technical, twisty routes, the Triton Fast will tackle it all with ease. Leveraging the cutting-edge aero technology of the Noah Fast 3.0, we’ve made the Triton Fast the fastest bike in the peloton. Get ready for speed, performance, and control—no matter the conditions.",
